text: ["({T}: Add {G} or {U}.)\nAs Breeding Pool enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", "({T}: Add {R} or {G}.)\nAs Stomping Ground enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", "({T}: Add {R} or {W}.)\nAs Sacred Foundry enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", "({T}: Add {U} or {B}.)\nAs Watery Grave enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", "({T}: Add {W} or {B}.)\nAs Godless Shrine enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", 'Arrows of Justice deals 4 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', 'As Realmwright enters the battlefield, choose a basic land type.\nLands you control are the chosen type in addition to their other types.', 'At the beginning of the end step, if you control four or more creatures named Biovisionary, you win the game.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put a muster counter on Assemble the Legion. Then create a 1/1 red and white Soldier creature token with haste for each muster counter on Assemble the Legion.', "Aurelia's Fury deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of targets. Tap each creature dealt damage this way. Players dealt damage this way can't cast noncreature spells this turn.", 'Battalion — Whenever Bomber Corps and at least two other creatures attack, Bomber Corps deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Battalion — Whenever Boros Elite and at least two other creatures attack, Boros Elite gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Battalion — Whenever Daring Skyjek and at least two other creatures attack, Daring Skyjek gains flying until end of turn.', "Battalion — Whenever Firefist Striker and at least two other creatures attack, target creature can't block this turn.", 'Battalion — Whenever Frontline Medic and at least two other creatures attack, creatures you control gain indestructible until end of turn.\nSacrifice Frontline Medic: Counter target spell with {X} in its mana cost unless its controller pays {3}.', 'Battalion — Whenever Nav Squad Commandos and at least two other creatures attack, Nav Squad Commandos gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Untap it.', 'Battalion — Whenever Ordruun Veteran and at least two other creatures attack, Ordruun Veteran gains double strike until end of turn. (It deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'Battalion — Whenever Warmind Infantry and at least two other creatures attack, Warmind Infantry gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Battalion — Whenever Wojek Halberdiers and at least two other creatures attack, Wojek Halberdiers gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Bloodrush — {1}{G}, Discard Scab-Clan Charger: Target attacking creature gets +2/+4 until end of turn.', 'Bloodrush — {1}{R}{G}, Discard Zhur-Taa Swine: Target attacking creature gets +5/+4 until end of turn.', 'Bloodrush — {1}{R}{R}, Discard Scorchwalker: Target attacking creature gets +5/+1 until end of turn.', 'Bloodrush — {G}, Discard Slaughterhorn: Target attacking creature gets +3/+2 until end of turn.', 'Bloodrush — {R}, Discard Skinbrand Goblin: Target attacking creature gets +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Boros Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.', 'Choose one or more —\n• Clan Defiance deals X damage to target creature with flying.\n• Clan Defiance deals X damage to target creature without flying.\n• Clan Defiance deals X damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Choose one —\n• Boros Charm deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker.\n• Permanents you control gain indestructible until end of turn.\n• Target creature gains double strike until end of turn.', "Choose one —\n• Counter target sorcery spell.\n• Destroy target creature with power 2 or less.\n• Look at the top three cards of target player's library. Put one back and the rest into that player's graveyard.", "Choose one —\n• Creatures without flying can't block this turn.\n• Gain control of all permanents you own.\n• Gruul Charm deals 3 damage to each creature with flying.", 'Choose one —\n• Exile all artifacts.\n• Exile all creatures.\n• Exile all enchantments.\n• Exile all planeswalkers.', "Choose one —\n• Return target creature you control and all Auras you control attached to it to their owner's hand.\n• Destroy target creature and you lose life equal to its toughness.\n• Return target creature card with mana value 1 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.", "Choose one —\n• Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.\n• Permanents you control gain hexproof until end of turn.\n• Return target creature to its owner's hand.", "Choose target creature you control. You gain life equal to that creature's power plus its toughness.", "Consuming Aberration's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your opponents' graveyards.\nWhenever you cast a spell, each opponent reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a land card, then puts those cards into their graveyard.", 'Counter target noncreature spell.\nDraw a card.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}, where X is the greatest power among creatures you control.', "Counter target spell. Create an X/X green Ooze creature token, where X is that spell's mana value.", 'Counter target spell. Its controller mills two cards.', 'Create a 1/1 blue and black Horror creature token with flying.\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)', "Create a token that's a copy of target artifact or creature.\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)", 'Create an X/X green Ooze creature token, where X is the greatest power among creatures you control.', 'Create two 2/2 white Knight creature tokens with vigilance.', 'Creature tokens get -1/-1.', 'Creatures blocking or blocked by Alms Beast have lifelink.', 'Creatures you control get +0/+1 for each Gate you control and have vigilance.', 'Creatures you control get +0/+5 and gain reach until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control have base power and toughness X/X until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control have haste and attack each combat if able.', "Creatures your opponents control with hexproof can be the targets of spells and abilities you control as though they didn't have hexproof.\n{3}, Sacrifice Glaring Spotlight: Creatures you control gain hexproof until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn.", "Deathcult Rogue can't be blocked except by Rogues.", 'Deathtouch\nBloodrush — {G}, Discard Wasteland Viper: Target attacking creature gets +1/+2 and gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Defender\nEvolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)', 'Defender\nExtort (Whenever you cast a spell, you may pay {W/B}. If you do, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain that much life.)', 'Defender\nSacrifice another creature: Corpse Blockade gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target blocked creature.', 'Destroy target creature with power X or less.', "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated. That creature's controller creates a 3/3 green Frog Lizard creature token.", 'Destroy target land. Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "Destroy target nonartifact creature. Its controller mills cards equal to that creature's power.", 'Dimir Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Double strike\nBloodrush — {3}{R}{R}, Discard Wrecking Ogre: Target attacking creature gets +3/+3 and gains double strike until end of turn.', 'Draw a card.\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)', 'Draw cards equal to the number of cards in your library, then put a card from your hand on top of your library. You have no maximum hand size until your next turn.', 'Draw three cards. You may play an additional land this turn.', "Each opponent reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal X land cards, then puts all cards revealed this way into their graveyard. X can't be 0.", "Each other creature you control enters the battlefield with a number of additional +1/+1 counters on it equal to Master Biomancer's power and as a Mutant in addition to its other types.", 'Each player discards their hand, then draws cards equal to the greatest number of cards a player discarded this way.\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)', "Elusive Krasis can't be blocked.\nEvolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)", "Ember Beast can't attack or block alone.", 'Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on enchanted creature.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, that player loses 1 life.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has flying and lifelink.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has protection from creatures.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2.\nEnchanted creature can't be blocked as long as you control a Gate.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+0 and has menace.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has haste.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -5/-0.\n{2}{U}: Return Agoraphobia to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -X/-X, where X is the number of creature cards in its controller's graveyard.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has hexproof and can't be blocked by more than one creature.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has protection from multicolored.', "Enchant creature\nYou control enchanted creature.\nDiscard two cards: Soul Ransom's controller sacrifices it, then draws two cards. Only your opponents may activate this ability.", 'Enchant creature you control\nWhen enchanted creature dies, create X 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens, where X is its power.', 'Enchant creature you control\nWhen enchanted creature dies, target player loses X life and you gain X life, where X is its power.', 'Enchant land\nEnchanted land has "{T}, Discard a card: Draw a card."', 'Enchant land\nEnchanted land has "{T}: Tap target creature."', 'Enchant land\nEnchanted land has "{T}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery."', 'Enchant land\nEnchanted land is a Swamp.\nWhenever enchanted land becomes tapped, its controller loses 2 life.', 'Enchant land\nWhen Verdant Haven enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional one mana of any color.', "Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and can't be blocked by creatures with flying.\nEquip {3} ({3}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", 'Equipped creature gets +1/+2.\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Evolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)', 'Evolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\nRemove two +1/+1 counters from Experiment One: Regenerate Experiment One. (The next time this creature would be destroyed, instead tap it, remove it from combat, and heal all damage on it.)', 'Evolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\nWhenever a +1/+1 counter is put on Fathom Mage, you may draw a card.', 'Evolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\n{1}{U}, {T}: Move a +1/+1 counter from Simic Fluxmage onto target creature.', 'Evolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\n{T}, Remove one or more +1/+1 counters from Simic Manipulator: Gain control of target creature with power less than or equal to the number of +1/+1 counters removed this way.', 'Evolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\n{T}: Add {G} for each +1/+1 counter on Gyre Sage.', 'Exile target artifact.', 'Exile target card from a graveyard. Create a 1/1 white and black Spirit creature token with flying.', 'Exile target creature or enchantment.', "Exile target creature. Return it to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)", 'Extort (Whenever you cast a spell, you may pay {W/B}. If you do, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain that much life.)', 'Extort (Whenever you cast a spell, you may pay {W/B}. If you do, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain that much life.)\nArtifacts and creatures your opponents control enter the battlefield tapped.', 'Extort (Whenever you cast a spell, you may pay {W/B}. If you do, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain that much life.)\nWhen Vizkopa Confessor enters the battlefield, pay any amount of life. Target opponent reveals that many cards from their hand. You choose one of them and exile it.', 'Extort (Whenever you cast a spell, you may pay {W/B}. If you do, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain that much life.)\nWhenever Treasury Thrull attacks, you may return target artifact, creature, or enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Extort (Whenever you cast a spell, you may pay {W/B}. If you do, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain that much life.)\nWhenever you tap a Swamp for mana, add an additional {B}.', 'Extort (Whenever you cast a spell, you may pay {W/B}. If you do, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain that much life.)\n{T}, Pay 2 life: Remove a counter from target nonland permanent.', 'First strike\nBloodrush — {2}{R}, Discard Viashino Shanktail: Target attacking creature gets +3/+1 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nEvolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)', 'Flying', 'Flying\nAt the beginning of each combat, choose first strike, vigilance, or lifelink. Creatures you control gain that ability until end of turn.', "Flying\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, each player reveals the top card of their library, loses life equal to that card's mana value, then puts it into their hand.", 'Flying\nBattalion — Whenever Firemane Avenger and at least two other creatures attack, Firemane Avenger deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\nCreatures with flying your opponents control get -1/-1.', 'Flying\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has flying.', 'Flying\nEvolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)', 'Flying\nExtort (Whenever you cast a spell, you may pay {W/B}. If you do, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain that much life.)', "Flying\nGuardian of the Gateless can block any number of creatures.\nWhenever Guardian of the Gateless blocks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature it's blocking.", 'Flying\nNimbus Swimmer enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.', 'Flying\nWhen Balustrade Spy enters the battlefield, target player reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a land card, then puts those cards into their graveyard.', 'Flying\nWhen Deathpact Angel dies, create a 1/1 white and black Cleric creature token. It has "{3}{W}{B}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice this creature: Return a card named Deathpact Angel from your graveyard to the battlefield."', "Flying\nWhen Diluvian Primordial enters the battlefield, for each opponent, you may cast up to one target instant or sorcery card from that player's graveyard without paying its mana cost. If a spell cast this way would be put into a graveyard, exile it instead.", 'Flying\nWhen Mindeye Drake dies, target player mills five cards.', "Flying\nWhenever Lord of the Void deals combat damage to a player, exile the top seven cards of that player's library, then put a creature card from among them onto the battlefield under your control.", 'Flying\nWhenever Nightveil Specter deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.\nYou may play lands and cast spells from among cards exiled with Nightveil Specter.', 'Flying\n{U}: Metropolis Sprite gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, trample', 'Flying, trample\nWhenever Hellkite Tyrant deals combat damage to a player, gain control of all artifacts that player controls.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you control twenty or more artifacts, you win the game.', 'Flying, vigilance, haste\nWhenever Aurelia, the Warleader attacks for the first time each turn, untap all creatures you control. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase.', 'Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Ground Assault deals damage to target creature equal to the number of lands you control.', 'Gruul Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', "Haste\nBattalion — Whenever Legion Loyalist and at least two other creatures attack, creatures you control gain first strike and trample until end of turn and can't be blocked by creature tokens this turn.", 'Haste\nWhen Molten Primordial enters the battlefield, for each opponent, gain control of up to one target creature that player controls until end of turn. Untap those creatures. They gain haste until end of turn.', "Hexproof\nWhenever a creature card is put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, you may have Lazav, Dimir Mastermind become a copy of that card, except its name is Lazav, Dimir Mastermind, it's legendary in addition to its other types, and it has hexproof and this ability.", 'Homing Lightning deals 4 damage to target creature and each other creature with the same name as that creature.', "Intimidate (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)\nWhen Sepulchral Primordial enters the battlefield, for each opponent, you may put up to one target creature card from that player's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.", "Keymaster Rogue can't be blocked.\nWhen Keymaster Rogue enters the battlefield, return a creature you control to its owner's hand.", 'Massive Raid deals damage to any target equal to the number of creatures you control.', "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Move any number of +1/+1 counters from target creature onto another target creature with the same controller.', "Mugging deals 2 damage to target creature. That creature can't block this turn.", 'Orzhov Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}.', "Players can't gain life this turn. Damage can't be prevented this turn. Skullcrack deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn by creatures with no +1/+1 counters on them.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to Armored Transport by creatures blocking it.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.', 'Prime Speaker Zegana enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the greatest power among other creatures you control.\nWhen Prime Speaker Zegana enters the battlefield, draw cards equal to its power.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature and untap it.', "Put target nonland permanent on top of its owner's library.", 'Reach\nWhen Sylvan Primordial enters the battlefield, for each opponent, destroy target noncreature permanent that player controls. For each permanent destroyed this way, search your library for a Forest card and put that card onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nEvolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)', "Return all attacking creatures to their owner's hand.", 'Return each creature card with mana value X from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)', "Rubblehulk's power and toughness are each equal to the number of lands you control.\nBloodrush — {1}{R}{G}, Discard Rubblehulk: Target attacking creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of lands you control.", 'Sacrifice another creature: Cartel Aristocrat gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Search your library for three creature cards and reveal them. If you reveal three cards with different names, choose one of them at random and put that card into your hand. Shuffle the rest into your library.', "Shuffle Serene Remembrance and up to three target cards from a single graveyard into their owners' libraries.", "Shuffle your library, then reveal the top card. If it's a nonland card, you may cast it without paying its mana cost. If it's a land card, you may put it onto the battlefield and return Unexpected Results to its owner's hand.", 'Simic Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.', "Spire Tracer can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.", 'Tap X target nonland permanents.', 'Tap an untapped Gate you control: Crackling Perimeter deals 1 damage to each opponent.', "Tap target creature an opponent controls. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)", 'Target blocking creature gets +3/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', "Target creature an opponent controls blocks this turn if able. Untap that creature. Other creatures that player controls can't block this turn.", 'Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains flying and first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+0 until end of turn.\nTarget creature gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature that dealt damage this turn gets -5/-5 until end of turn.', 'Target creature you control fights another target creature. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)', "Target land becomes a 3/3 Elemental creature with flying until end of turn. It's still a land.", 'Target opponent discards two cards and you gain 2 life.', 'Target opponent loses 3 life.\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)', 'Target player discards a card.\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)', 'Target player loses 1 life, discards a card, then sacrifices a permanent.\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)', 'Target player mills four cards. You draw a card for each creature card put into their graveyard this way.', 'Target player mills three cards.\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)', "Target player sacrifices a creature, then gains life equal to that creature's toughness.", 'Target player sacrifices an artifact and a land. Structural Collapse deals 2 damage to that player.', 'Trample\nBloodrush — {5}{G}{G}, Discard Skarrg Goliath: Target attacking creature gets +9/+9 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Trample\nBloodrush — {R}{G}, Discard Ghor-Clan Rampager: Target attacking creature gets +4/+4 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Trample\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has trample.', 'Trample\nWhenever Borborygmos Enraged deals combat damage to a player, reveal the top three cards of your library. Put all land cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.\nDiscard a land card: Borborygmos Enraged deals 3 damage to any target.', "Trample\nWhenever Giant Adephage deals combat damage to a player, create a token that's a copy of Giant Adephage.", 'Trample, lifelink, haste\nAt the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Spark Trooper.', 'Vigilance\nExtort (Whenever you cast a spell, you may pay {W/B}. If you do, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain that much life.)', 'Vigilance\nWhen Luminate Primordial enters the battlefield, for each opponent, exile up to one target creature that player controls and that player gains life equal to its power.', 'Vigilance\n{R}{W}: Truefire Paladin gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\n{R}{W}: Truefire Paladin gains first strike until end of turn.', 'When Burning-Tree Emissary enters the battlefield, add {R}{G}.', "When Dinrova Horror enters the battlefield, return target permanent to its owner's hand, then that player discards a card.", 'When Foundry Champion enters the battlefield, it deals damage to any target equal to the number of creatures you control.\n{R}: Foundry Champion gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\n{W}: Foundry Champion gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', "When Leyline Phantom deals combat damage, return it to its owner's hand. (Return it only if it survived combat.)", "When Mortus Strider dies, return it to its owner's hand.", "When Obzedat, Ghost Council enters the battlefield, target opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.\nAt the beginning of your end step, you may exile Obzedat. If you do, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of your next upkeep. It gains haste.", 'When Prophetic Prism enters the battlefield, draw a card.\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'When Urbis Protector enters the battlefield, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying.', 'Whenever Boros Reckoner is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to any target.\n{R/W}: Boros Reckoner gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Whenever Fortress Cyclops attacks, it gets +3/+0 until end of turn.\nWhenever Fortress Cyclops blocks, it gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Gruul Ragebeast or another creature enters the battlefield under your control, that creature fights target creature an opponent controls.', 'Whenever High Priest of Penance is dealt damage, you may destroy target nonland permanent.', 'Whenever Rubblebelt Raiders attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it for each attacking creature you control.', 'Whenever Rust Scarab becomes blocked, you may destroy target artifact or enchantment defending player controls.', 'Whenever Slate Street Ruffian becomes blocked, defending player discards a card.', 'Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage, put a blaze counter on Five-Alarm Fire.\nRemove five blaze counters from Five-Alarm Fire: It deals 5 damage to any target.', "Whenever an ability of equipped creature is activated, if it isn't a mana ability, copy that ability. You may choose new targets for the copy.\nEquip {3}", "Whenever another black creature enters the battlefield under your control, target creature gains intimidate until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)", 'Whenever another blue creature enters the battlefield under your control, target player mills two cards.', 'Whenever another green creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Whenever another nontoken creature dies, you may create a 1/1 black Rat creature token.\nRats you control have deathtouch.', 'Whenever another red creature enters the battlefield under your control, Foundry Street Denizen gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever another white creature enters the battlefield under your control, tap target creature an opponent controls.', "Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, Incursion Specialist gets +2/+0 until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn.", "Wight of Precinct Six gets +1/+1 for each creature card in your opponents' graveyards.", '[+1]: Look at the top card of your library. If it\'s a creature card, you may reveal it and put it into your hand.\n[−2]: Target creature you control fights another target creature.\n[−7]: You get an emblem with "Creatures you control have double strike, trample, hexproof, and haste."', "[+1]: Put a loyalty counter on Gideon, Champion of Justice for each creature target opponent controls.\n[0]: Until end of turn, Gideon, Champion of Justice becomes a Human Soldier creature with power and toughness each equal to the number of loyalty counters on him and gains indestructible. He's still a planeswalker. Prevent all damage that would be dealt to him this turn.\n[−15]: Exile all other permanents.", '{1}, Sacrifice a creature: Target player reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a land card, then puts those cards into their graveyard.', '{1}, {T}: Razortip Whip deals 1 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.', '{1}{G}, Remove one or more +1/+1 counters from among creatures you control: Create an X/X green Ooze creature token, where X is the number of +1/+1 counters removed this way.', '{1}{G}: Frilled Oculus gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', '{1}{R}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.\n{2}{R}{W}: Create a 1/1 red and white Soldier creature token with haste.', "{1}{U}{B}: Whenever a card is put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere this turn, that player loses 1 life.\n{2}{U}{B}: Target player mills two cards.", '{1}{W}, {T}: You gain 2 life.', '{1}{W}{B}: Target creature gains lifelink until end of turn.\n{1}{W}{B}: Whenever you gain life this turn, each opponent loses that much life.', '{B}: Gateway Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\nTap an untapped Gate you control: Gateway Shade gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{B}: Regenerate Dutiful Thrull.', '{G}{U}: This turn, each creature you control enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.\n{G}{U}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from a creature you control: Draw a card.', '{R}: Disciple of the Old Ways gains first strike until end of turn.', "{R}{G}: Creatures you control gain trample until end of turn.\n{1}{R}{G}: Target land you control becomes a 4/4 Elemental creature until end of turn. It's still a land.", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}, {T}: Thespian's Stage becomes a copy of target land, except it has this ability.", "{T}: Add {G} or {U}.\n{G}{U}: Simic Keyrune becomes a 2/3 green and blue Crab artifact creature with hexproof until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", '{T}: Add {R} or {G}.\n{R}{G}: Gruul Keyrune becomes a 3/2 red and green Beast artifact creature with trample until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {R} or {W}.\n{R}{W}: Boros Keyrune becomes a 1/1 red and white Soldier artifact creature with double strike until end of turn. (It deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', "{T}: Add {U} or {B}.\n{U}{B}: Dimir Keyrune becomes a 2/2 blue and black Horror artifact creature until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Add {W} or {B}.\n{W}{B}: Orzhov Keyrune becomes a 1/4 white and black Thrull artifact creature with lifelink until end of turn.', "{T}: Draw a card, then exile a card from your hand face down.\nYou may look at cards exiled with Bane Alley Broker.\n{U}{B}, {T}: Return a card exiled with Bane Alley Broker to its owner's hand.", '{T}: Untap target Gate.', "{U}: Horror of the Dim gains hexproof until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", '{W}: Towering Thunderfist gains vigilance until end of turn.', '{X}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Cinder Elemental: It deals X damage to any target.']
